Hi {Owner},

I build websites for breweries and taprooms around {City}. {Business Name} has a following and good reviews, but the tap list, events and food truck schedule only live in posts and stories that move on.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a live tap list your staff update from a phone, an events calendar, tonight's food truck, can release dates and taproom house rules with an age notice, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and keeping things current. You approve all licence and age wording. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth fifteen minutes before the taproom opens?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
